      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is comparison is specifically for the expanded nameplate (what shoes up when you go into the menu while looking at someone)\n\nFor the base nameplate, I wouldn't care about trust level or group info.\n\nHowever, group banner cropping and pronouns getting cut off still apply",
