  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-07-23T02:51:43.028Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new nameplates have some issues which are downgrades compared to the original nameplates:\n\n1. The new widgets for group, age verified, trust, and performance now cover the group banner.\n\n2. In the new widgets, the trust level and group code are not visible.\n\n3. With the new format for pronouns, the text is now cut off. In the original format, there was space for the text to not get cut off, but now it is still cut off, even though there is space. Ideally, pronouns should remain as a separate bubble.\n\n4. I also have issues with group banners getting cut off, but that can be discussed in other posts\n\nI attached a diagram to compare the new and old nameplates.\n\nI have also attached a simple mock-up for how the new expanded nameplates could look.",
